  "contentHtml": "<p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래의 글들은 sedu21.com 운영진들이 카톡을 통해 나눈 이야기입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">망치는 수업을 하자!</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&lt;혁신공감학교 추진 추진현황 진단 및 정책 제안&nbsp; p.15, 경기도교육연구원&gt; </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DIIg%26dataid%3D102%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20160402104221&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile278.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F2640BB3D56FF22A618BD6B')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 혁신공감학교 추진현황 진단 및 정책 제안-(정책진단 2015-05).pdf</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22192D4556FF22310B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"658\" height=\"246\" style=\"width: 658px; height: 246px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"망치는 수업을 하자.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"758\"  id=\"A_22192D4556FF22310B73A7\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">함께 나눌 수 있기에 용기가 생기는거겠지요?</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 함께 하기에 용기가 생긴다는 것, 참 멋진 말!</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">일명 튀는 수업을 나 혼자 하는 것은 참 힘들어요.<br>그래서 미루고 미루고 그랬나봐요.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">정말 해보고 싶은데 망칠까봐 못 해봤던거...</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">13년차에 이제야 겨우 신규랑 열심히 이것저것 시도해보고 있습니다~</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 참으로 감동적인 이야기!</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">다 같이 허우적허우적^______^<br>그래서 여기저기 열심히 찾아보고 이야기 나누고 있어요.<br>재과만에서 많이 얻고 있어 항상 감사드리고 있답니다~^^</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">우리 모두 멋져집시다!!^^<br>열심히 망쳐보겠습니다 ㅎ <br>다 같이 허우적허우적^______^</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 망치는 수업의 대가 : 김신혜선생님!!!<br></p><p><br></p><p>ㅋㅋㅋ 분명 칭찬인데 ㅎㅎ</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 칭찬 맞습니데이~</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 당신의 도전 정신을 존경합니다. 그리고 사랑합니다♡</p><p><br></p><p>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>아래에 선생님들의 댓글을 부탁드립니다~</strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong>선생님들과 이야기 함께 나누고 싶습니다!</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
